theorem most_of_the_unstated_remainder_stays_inside_one_wing : ((43445 * 5 > 98350 * 2) ∧ (43445 * 2 < 98350)) ∧ (43445 < 98350) := by decide

/-- CLAIMED: the 1530 formula-shaped statements across 115 wings are built from 779 distinct integers and state
